      "uid": "zhcn:f68b0e3c2d36774db6076c0e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为他人尽心尽力的赛马娘，比萨胜驹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b375f6a84fe16b41d394ff5435d1f971e9271fa436c914e35f2a7beb79cacea2",
